scalated</strong><br>A human agent will follow up with you within 2 business hours.</div>' : '' }}     <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;\">     <p style=\"color: #888; font-size: 12px;\">This call was handled by InsurVoice AI, an automated assistant for Allianz Direct. Call reference: {{ $json.body.call_id }}<br>     AI identity disclosed in line with EU AI Act Article 52. Audio not retained (GDPR compliant).</p>   </div> </body> </html>",
